A Claude Code Setup hook that runs a committed script through an
interpreter. It is listed.
-- .claude/settings.json --
{
  "hooks": {
    "Setup": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash scripts/init.sh" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
-- scripts/init.sh --
#!/bin/sh
echo "init"
